WEBVTT

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.240
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.140
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.950
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.400
Who I wanna be.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.650
They call me calm, strong, and cool.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:40.000
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.410
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.620
I'm just an ordinary girl!

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:50.730
I wish I could just get rid

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:54.510
of all this pressure and be myself.

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.350
But they'd all say it's out of character.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:02.760
Unlock my heart!

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:08.110
Just be who you wanna be.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.960
Your Guardian Characters are with you.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.210
Just do it the way you wanna do it.

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.280
It'll be okay, really!

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:23.190
Just be who you wanna be.

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:25.960
Having only one style would be way too boring.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:30.220
Just do it the way you wanna do it.

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:34.490
You can do anything!

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.110
I know that...

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.950
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.840
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:41.710
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:43.020
...is who I wanna be.

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:01.700
The shadow of desire covering the writhing city

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:05.030
prowls about in an angel's guise.

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:08.300
Cradling, as if precious, the shards

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.320
Hey, it's Utau-chan!

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:11.680
of dreams that have no place left to go.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:11.680
Utau-chan's so cool!

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:18.400
As sleep is about to take you,

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:24.950
where will you find a pleasant dream?

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:29.720
Kiss the starry sky...

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.420
Ikuto.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.360
Why didn't you come on Christmas Eve?

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.970
Come to the next concert.

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:45.570
You have to.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:53.430
Big Disturbance!  New Year Live!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:53.430
Episode 13

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.220
Library

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.220
A New Year's concert?

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:00.150
Yep.

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:03.930
A bunch of pop idols are holding a special concert to kick off the new year!

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.840
Amu-chi, are you coming with us?

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:06.730
Huh?

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:07.990
I can come along?

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.140
Of course!

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:12.250
I worked hard to get five tickets!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.930
Hey, not bad.

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:16.890
Nothing's impossible for me!

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.200
You want to see P-TUNE, right?

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.370
I'm so over being hooked on them.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.620
My heart belongs to Shou-kun from DARTS now!

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.350
I see you're as fickle as ever.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.210
As for myself,

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:32.270
I remain devoted to the prince of enka, Kagawa Masashi-sama!

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.850
What? Shou-kun's way cooler!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.850
This'll be the first time I've ever gone to a concert.

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:38.400
But I have to get permission from Mom and Dad.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:38.400
Yaya-chan still has some growing up to do.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.350
Oh my, Amu-chan, she's...

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:41.810
Ah.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.180
Hoshina Utau.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:46.270
So she's performing, too.

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:52.340
The Easter people are getting serious.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.770
Now's your last chance to get out.

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:00.140
What's wrong, Hinamori-san?

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:02.210
Oh, um...

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:05.290
How typical of the Guardians.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:08.350
You work so enthusiastically even during winter break, huh?

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.420
Nikaidou-sensei.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:12.350
H-How long have you been standing there?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:17.040
You know, I can't say I approve of children going to a concert by themselves.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.760
Oh, um, uh...

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:19.930
But don't worry!

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:21.460
Ta-da!

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.180
Your teacher also has a ticket.

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.180
So you're saying...

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:31.930
I'm sure your parents will feel a lot safer if I'm with you.

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.580
Right, Himamori-san?

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.260
W-With a teacher?

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.060
What? You mean...

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:41.770
Utau-chan is friends with Ikuto?

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:42.900
Yeah.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.650
And I'm a bit worried

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.830
about what this Easter Ikuto mentioned is.

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:52.570
Perhaps by Easter he's referring to that famous corporation?

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:54.100
One of Japan's most prominent.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:55.490
If that's true...

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:57.040
What? What? What?

00:04:57.590 --> 00:04:59.970
I had a feeling something unnatural was going on.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:05.390
Recently, X Eggs have been manifesting at a frequent rate, agreed?

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:10.180
And those X Eggs are even hatching into X Characters.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:14.670
Now that you mention it, I'd never seen an X Character until recently.

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:15.590
Exactly.

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.810
And now they're hatching one after another.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.310
Which means that...

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:23.990
Could those Easter guys be targeting our school?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:30.680
So they're the ones who put X's on Yuki-chan's, Yamada-kun's, Maika-chan's and Misaki's hearts' eggs?

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.710
When you look at it that way, everything makes sense.

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.060
Unbelievable.

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:39.470
In other words, the enemy is already upon us.

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:43.140
We must be careful.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:47.180
We have to protect everyone's eggs!

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:47.620
Yep.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:48.430
Uh-huh.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:49.410
Yes.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.120
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.460
You can't fall asleep?

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:01.710
It's unforgivable.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:02.350
Huh?

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:05.810
Putting X's on people's hearts' eggs.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:10.290
For all we know, someone could be targeting the school right now.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:11.310
Who do you mean?

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.830
Amu-chan, do you suspect who it might be?

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:20.320
What was Ikuto doing there on Christmas night?

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:21.560
So it's Ikuto?

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:23.680
I-It couldn't be!

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:25.940
Would he be capable of that?

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:29.970
Of making Yuki-chan, Yamada-kun and everyone else suffer?

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.300
He's...

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:43.320
What is this?

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:44.070
That?

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.050
It's your outfit for the concert tomorrow.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:46.860
Why this now?

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.930
I'm seriously worrying about something here!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:50.850
How about this one, then?

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:52.580
Wow!

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:53.700
That might work!

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:54.940
Wanna try it on?

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:55.810
Yep! Yep!

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.840
All right, let's do it!

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:00.140
Drew! Draw! Drawn!

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.040
All right.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.970
Coordination through Character Change complete!

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:07.740
That's our Miki!

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.890
You have the fashion sense of a dazzling artist!

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:12.550
Amu-chi!

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:15.150
Over here! Hurry up!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.270
Hey, Hinamori!

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:15.770
Over here!

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:19.070
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:21.130
You look so cute, Amu-chi!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:24.300
You're looking pretty good yourself, Yaya.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:27.100
Hey, everybody!

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:28.730
Sorry I'm late!

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:29.600
Whoops!

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:33.090
We weren't really waiting for you.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.190
Look at all the people.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.640
Let's see, our seats are that way.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.560
Ah!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:44.180
Amu-chi, go buy us ice cream!

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:46.060
I'll buy takoyaki!

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:48.270
You'll have to make do with popcorn.

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:50.730
Look at how long the lines are.

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.560
Jeez, so stingy.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.550
Easter?

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:57.350
Hey, you're right!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:58.560
Look.

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:00.180
Over there, too.

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:05.040
It's not just the juice and food.

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:08.010
This hall is owned by Easter, too,

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:10.310
and they're also sponsoring tonight's concert.

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:16.680
By the way, Hoshina Utau apparently belongs to Easter's music label.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.020
Well then...

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:20.030
I need to go to the restroom.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:22.780
Please go on inside the hall first.

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:25.120
Huh?

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.260
Where are Pepe-chan and the others?

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:28.720
Now that you mention it...

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.280
Count off!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:30.890
One!

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:31.660
Two!

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:32.360
Three!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:32.900
Chu!

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:33.800
Yes!

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:34.930
Present.

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:36.370
All right.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.680
Excellent, all the Guardian Characters have assembled.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:40.520
Why have we gathered here?

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:43.770
I wanted to watch the concert with Amu-chan.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.100
Cease your chatter!

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:49.160
Now that we know Easter is after the Embryo,

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.960
we must train our weakened bodies

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:53.350
in case trouble arises, don't you agree?

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:54.930
I will be the one to obtain the Embryo

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:57.720
and become King of the World!

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:01.730
So warm.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.770
He can actually be useful every once in a while.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.220
Indeed.

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:06.900
So cool.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.750
Phew, I finally got it.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:13.390
Huh?

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:15.810
I wonder where everyone went.

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:18.340
Or wait, am I lost?

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:22.870
Ikuto.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:30.630
I'll just ask him straight out.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:32.260
About Christmas night.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:34.220
And about Easter.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:46.770
I thought he went this way.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:48.810
Hello there, Ikuto-kun.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.350
I haven't seen you in a while.

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.640
Who did that voice belong to?

00:09:53.640 --> 00:10:00.420
I heard you attacked a number of street performers on Christmas Eve and took their X Eggs?

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:01.180
Huh?

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:02.410
Yes.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:04.700
But I was really behind it.

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:12.220
And, as usual, I had him clean up the mess.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:14.520
W-Was that Ikuto's voice?

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:16.100
I couldn't hear very clearly.

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:22.520
I heard that you've only found worthless X Eggs, even after targeting all those Seiyo Elementary kids.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:30.390
In any case, we must devote all of Easter's resources to finding the Embryo.

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:32.880
I have great expectations for tonight.

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.330
How many are there?

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:35.820
Are they all with Easter?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:36.840
Hey!

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:37.850
What are you doing?

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.810
This area is for authorized personnel only.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.560
I-I'm so sorry!

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.090
Is something wrong?

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.140
No.

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:50.380
Amu-chi!

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:52.370
Jeez, where did you go?

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:54.520
We were looking for you.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.170
It melted!

00:10:56.170 --> 00:11:00.140
My ice cream.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:11:00.140
Let's go. The concert's about to begin.

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:01.120
Ah.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:03.150
Yeah.

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:09.370
New Year's Concert Performer

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:09.370
Miss Hoshina Utau

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:13.300
Utau-chan, five minutes to curtain.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.350
I can't wait!

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:32.100
It's so exciting!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:33.310
Yep.

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:35.620
Utau-chan's super cute!

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:37.060
And she's a good singer!

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:39.930
I hope it starts soon!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.140
Wow, everyone's sparkling.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.320
I'm definitely gonna be a singer!

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:48.140
One day, I'll stand on the same stage as Utau-chan!

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.790
Singers are really amazing.

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:53.640
They can make everyone smile.

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:00.960
Thank you all so much for waiting!

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.630
The special Ringing in the New Year concert will now begin!

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:07.440
Let's go, Utau.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.670
Utau?

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:10.660
I quit.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:11.100
What?

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:14.100
I'm not singing tonight.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:18.100
Sanjo-san, I agreed to look for the Embryo.

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:22.180
But I don't want to be singing for that purpose.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.900
So what?

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:24.850
I already told you.

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:28.200
You're obligated by contract to work for Easter.

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:32.790
You and Ikuto-kun can no longer escape their grasp.

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:35.100
You're like birds in a cage.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:38.080
Or would you rather I call you butterflies?

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:39.240
Honestly.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:42.560
I would've scouted a different girl if I'd known this would happen.

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:46.520
That girl with three Guardian Characters.

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:50.020
I believe her name was Hinamori Amu.

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:53.500
I won't lose.

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:57.930
I won't lose to her.

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:25.760
Open your shiny eyes in the silent night.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.890
Swooping down on this mysterious eve,

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:32.500
sneaking up close without making a footstep,

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:35.390
the black cat makes a seductive pose.

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:38.870
Yay, Utau!

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:42.720
Its silhouette stands tall in the moonlight.

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:40.900
Wow.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:43.220
The atmosphere instantly changed.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:52.920
I sing of freedom on invisible wings...

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:45.450
Don't let your guard down.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.600
We cannot know what might happen.

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:48.720
Roger!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.990
I'm amazed she can go along with that.

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.650
The concert started.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:55.350
Just give up-dechu.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.220
Whatcha guys doin'?

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:59.440
Training, as usual.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:02.260
Yoru!

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:04.140
I'm gonna go mess with him-nya.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.920
I'm the Alley Cat King!

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:10.530
Yoru!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:11.900
What are you doing?

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:12.800
Follow me.

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:14.870
I'll train you.

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.640
Everyone, after him!

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:22.220
...of dreams that have no place left to go.

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:28.680
As sleep is about to take you,

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:35.220
where will you find a pleasant dream?

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:38.690
Kiss the starry sky;

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:45.680
the time has come for good children to sleep.

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:49.140
Huh? Wings?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:54.070
Don't stare at me, don't capture me.

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:52.810
It's about to start.

00:14:54.070 --> 00:15:00.560
I'm a butterfly that's lost her way.

00:14:57.490 --> 00:15:00.560
That girl would do anything for you.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:04.270
She'd even choose to do very bad things.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:07.680
I sing of freedom on invisible wings;

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:14.540
I've hidden them deep inside your heart.

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:27.810
The face reflected in the mirror

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:29.910
No way! Are those...

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:31.520
was nothing but a crybaby back then.

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:31.540
Heart's eggs?

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:32.950
For real?!

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:35.040
But I'm no longer a child;

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.270
In a place like this?

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:38.060
I've let down this long-grown hair.

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:44.770
Pressing the sweet fragrance close to my chest,

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.390
Utau's singing has a magic-like power.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.890
It causes children to have big dreams,

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:45.930
leaving their hearts defenseless

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:51.470
its temptation makes me realize

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:48.270
and making it easier to take their eggs.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:51.470
Well, will the Embryo be among today's eggs?

00:15:51.470 --> 00:16:01.170
its spell on my lips left me lost for words.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.770
If not, they'll just be garbage.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.510
Stupid thieving cat.

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:00.260
Where did he go?

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.270
Whoa! Look, look!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.940
Wow! So many people!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:10.040
Don't stare at me, don't capture me.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:06.640
Huh?

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.560
Heart's eggs!

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.620
What?

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.430
Four of them!

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:17.390
I'm a butterfly that's lost her way.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.900
What are you doing?

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:16.480
Quiet-dechu!

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:21.100
Dummy, that's dangerous!

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:23.140
I-It wasn't on purpose-dechu!

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:31.250
The concert has been canceled due to technical difficulties onstage!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.140
Please calmly move toward the exit!

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:36.220
They turned into X Eggs!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.470
They went outside!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.380
Ikuto's calling me-nya.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:40.500
You can have this back!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.560
Let us be off as well!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.960
What a shame.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:48.470
I guess none of them were the Embryo.

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:50.520
Utau, let's go.

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:52.430
Amu-chan!

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.850
Amu-chi!

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:55.380
Hinamori-san!

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:56.430
Hey!

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:07.000
I smell X Eggs!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.200
Let's hurry, Ikuto!

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.760
If we don't deal with them soon, we're gonna have one big mess-nya.

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:12.270
I know.

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.620
Wh-What happened?

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.430
I got separated from everyone else.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.840
What should I do?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.560
What's this feeling?

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:32.540
X Eggs?!

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:34.770
Are they the ones from earlier?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:42.640
Labyrinth! Labyrinth! Butterfly!

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:44.250
What do I do?

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.640
Without my Guardian Characters, I can't Character Change or Character Transform!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:12.640
Did he Character Transform?

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:24.220
What are you going to do with that egg?

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:26.660
Tell me!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:29.740
Were you the one who turned them into X Eggs?

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:32.310
Yuki-chan, Yamada-kun and Maika-chan...

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.310
All of their eggs...

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:38.270
Did you?!

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:42.480
Th-The egg was...

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:43.680
How could he?

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.540
Amu-chan!

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:51.060
The egg!

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.630
What's going to happen

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.970
to its owner and the character inside?

00:18:54.970 --> 00:19:03.100
I've always known it's impossible for me to become a singer, realistically speaking.

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:05.900
Just so you know...

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.810
Even without my help,

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:12.880
most people break unneeded eggs.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:16.880
That's what's happened to all the adults walking around with tired looks on their faces.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.100
They've long abandoned the egg holding who they wanted to be.

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:22.130
No...

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:24.100
It was really you.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:25.530
You did all of it.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:29.510
I hate you!

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:30.850
I hate you!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:36.990
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:39.020
Look! Look! X Eggs!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:44.520
Labyrinth! Labyrinth! Butterfly!

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:45.780
Amu-chan!

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:50.060
My heart:

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:51.430
Unlock!

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.770
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:38.470
Ah!

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:40.270
Amu-chan, they're getting away!

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:41.020
I know.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.270
Negative Heart:

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:46.680
Lock On!

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:54.430
Open Heart!

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.100
I've made up my mind.

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:15.120
I won't let you win!

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.770
Hinamori-san.

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:30.820
If Easter puts X's on everyone's eggs,

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:32.720
then I'll cleanse them all!

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:47.330
Amu-chan, you okay?

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:50.480
You cleansed three X Eggs at once.

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:51.470
I'm fine.

00:21:51.470 --> 00:21:52.800
Amu-chan!

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:54.140
Amu-chan!

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:02.540
I refuse to let them win.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:13.180
The shining stars are growing ever brighter.

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:17.800
The story appears to be turning to a new page.

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:41.390
Unless the world ends, I'll always

00:22:41.390 --> 00:22:44.160
love you!  Yeah, you!

00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:47.630
'Cause I just love, love, love you!

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:52.360
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living.

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:55.040
So figure it out already! Yeah, you!

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:58.680
Even though I love, love, love you,

00:22:59.380 --> 00:23:04.870
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't!

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:08.990
I wanna show you what's in my heart!

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:12.420
Oh yes! You're my one true hero.

00:23:12.420 --> 00:23:17.580
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:23.510
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider?

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:28.760
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger.

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:37.630
Ride through the wild land of youth.

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:52.290
Mountains! Snow! Snowboarding!

00:23:52.290 --> 00:23:53.970
Amu-chan's really excited!

00:23:53.970 --> 00:23:56.430
They're holding snowboarding lessons on a snowy mountain.

00:23:56.430 --> 00:23:57.190
Snowboarding?

00:23:57.190 --> 00:23:59.710
Are you good at that, Amu-chan?

00:23:59.710 --> 00:24:02.010
Mountains! Snow! Snowboard...

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:03.220
Looks like she isn't.

00:24:03.550 --> 00:24:05.220
So what if I'm not?!

00:24:05.220 --> 00:24:06.640
That's why I'm going to practice.

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:07.820
That's our Amu-chan!

00:24:07.820 --> 00:24:09.670
That's the spirit!

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:10.990
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:13.540
A Guardian Character at the Ski Slope!?
Snoppe's Appearance!

00:24:13.540 --> 00:24:15.240
What? A new Guardian Character?

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:17.140
I hope we can be friends!

00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:18.940
I can't wait!
